<title>USA: TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Ameritech Cup women's tennis tournament Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat 1-Monica Seles (U.S.) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 5-Martina Hingis</p>
<p>(Switzerland) 7-5 6-4</p>
</text>
